# BuildKit reads this instead of the root .dockerignore when building with
# -f deploy/document-worker/Dockerfile: the worker image needs exactly the
# kazma_core source and its hash-locked requirements, nothing else from the
# checkout (no data, worktrees, tests or other packages).
*
!kazma-core/kazma_core
!deploy/document-worker/requirements.txt
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
